---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Ghid marimi pantaloni cu snur lung';
const description = 'Ghid de marimi pentru pantaloni cu snur lung: talie, lungime, croiala, masuratori si recomandari utile. Alege corect!';
const canonical = 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur/';
const image = '/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg';
const schema = { '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebPage', name:title, url:canonical, image:new URL(image, canonical).href };
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} image={image} type="website" schema={schema}>
<section id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-inner-wrapper"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-badge">Streetwear Premium Import</div><h1 class="hero-h1">Ghid marimi<br/><span class="line2">pantaloni cu snur lung</span></h1><p class="hero-sub">Verifica talia, lungimea interioara si volumul croielii inainte sa alegi modelul.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi" class="btn-primary">Vezi colectia</a><a href="/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur" class="btn-ghost">Ghid marimi</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">100<span>%</span></div><div class="stat-label">Calitate superioara</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Unisex</div><div class="stat-label">Purtat si de femei</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">1-3<span>zile</span></div><div class="stat-label">Timp livrare</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Card</div><div class="stat-label">sau ramburs</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Tabel orientativ</h2><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:20px"><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">Marime</th><th style="text-align:left;padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">Talie</th><th style="text-align:left;padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">Lungime</th><th style="text-align:left;padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">Fit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:14px">S</td><td style="padding:14px">70-78 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">98 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">slim/regular</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px">M</td><td style="padding:14px">78-86 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">100 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">regular</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px">L</td><td style="padding:14px">86-94 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">102 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">loose</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px">XL</td><td style="padding:14px">94-104 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">104 cm</td><td style="padding:14px">oversized</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="margin-top:22px">Daca esti intre marimi, alege in functie de fitul dorit. Snurul lung ajuta reglajul, dar croiala ramane decisiva.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi" class="btn-primary">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="content-panel reveal" style="text-align:center"><span class="section-tag">// cumpara acum</span><h2 class="section-h2" style="margin:0 auto 18px">Pantaloni cu snur lung AtelierAXD</h2><p style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 26px">Daca ai ales stilul, mergi direct in magazin pentru modele disponibile, plata si livrare.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi" class="btn-primary">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></div></div></section></Layout>
